<title>USA: FGIC qualifies Somerville, Mass., for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies Somerville, Mass., for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance Somerville, Mass.'s $21.378 million general obligation bond deal, set for competitive sale at 1100 EST.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
